{"source":{"uri":"Features/Smoke/015_IM_Smoke_Test.feature","data":"@CLDC @IM @smoke_test @im_smoke_test @cldc_smoke_test\r\n\r\nFeature: IM Smoke Test\r\n  As a Commercial Lines Duck Creek policy processing user\r\n  I want to complete the IM Smoke Test workflow\r\n  So that the business transaction is executed with source-traceable data and verification\r\n\r\nBackground: Prepare Commercial Lines Duck Creek for policy processing\r\n\tGiven I open a browser session\r\nScenario Outline: IM Smoke Test - <stateCode>\r\n\tGiven test data \"<dataFile>\" and external data \"<externalDataFile>\" are loaded\r\n\tAnd I open the configured Commercial Lines Duck Creek application\r\n\tAnd I sign in to Commercial Lines Duck Creek using configured credentials\r\n\tAnd I start a new quote\r\n\tAnd I enter individual client information\r\n\tAnd I complete required policy information\r\n\tAnd I run insurance score\r\n\tAnd I navigate to Policy Info and Verify Desc\r\n\tAnd I click on QA button to logout\r\n\tAnd I open the configured Commercial Lines Duck Creek application\r\n\tAnd I sign in to Commercial Lines Duck Creek using configured credentials\r\n\tAnd I search for the quote description using quick search\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n\t| stateCode | dataFile                                           | stateVariant | stateName     | externalDataFile                    |\r\n\t| AZ        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_az.json | AZ           | Arizona       | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t| CT        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_ct.json | CT           | Connecticut   | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t| DE        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_de.json | DE           | Delaware      | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t| MA        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_ma.json | MA           | Massachusetts | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t| MD        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_md.json | MD           | Maryland      | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t#| ME        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_me.json | ME           | Maine         | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t#| NH        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_nh.json | NH           | New Hampshire | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t#| NJ        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_nj.json | NJ           | New Jersey    | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t#| NY        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_ny.json | NY           | New York      | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t#| OR        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_or.json | OR           | Oregon        | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t#| PA        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_pa.json | PA           | Pennsylvania  | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t#| RI        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_ri.json | RI           | Rhode Island  | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t#| VA        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_va.json | VA           | Virginia      | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t#| VT        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_vt.json | VT           | Vermont       | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t#| WA        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_wa.json | WA           | Washington    | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t#| WV        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/015_im_smoke_test_wv.json | WV           | West Virginia | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
